{"ticker":"JKHY","updated":"2026-10-30T22:55:04Z","profile":{"longName":"Jack Henry & Associates, Inc.","shortName":"Jack Henry & Associates, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.jackhenry.com","fullTimeEmployees":7300,"marketCap":11311869952,"trailingPE":23.114613,"forwardPE":20.415394,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.4458976,"pegRatio":1.94,"targetMeanPrice":188.10526,"targetHighPrice":209.0,"targetLowPrice":158.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.047,"earningsGrowth":-0.104,"grossMargins":0.43897998,"operatingMargins":0.22503,"profitMargins":0.19760999,"totalRevenue":2544338944,"beta":0.563,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":193.39,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":121.04,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.53},"summary":"Jack Henry & Associates, Inc. operates as a financial technology company that connects people and financial institutions through technology solutions and payment processing services in the United States. It operates through four segments: Core, Payments, Complementary, and Corporate Services. The Core segment provides core information processing platforms to banks and credit unions, which consists of integrated applications required to process deposit, loan, general ledger transactions, and maintain centralized accountholder information. The Payments segment offers secure payment processing tools and services, including ATM, money movement and embedded payment capabilities, remote deposit capture processing, and risk management products and services, as well as debit and credit card processing services, and online and mobile bill pay solutions. The Complementary segment provides software, and hosted processing platforms and services comprising digital/mobile banking, treasury, online account opening, fraud/anti-money laundering, and lending/deposit solutions. The Corporate Services segment offers hardware and other products. It offers specialized financial performance, imaging and payment, information security and risk management, retail delivery, and online and mobile solutions to financial services organizations and corporate entities. The company also provides SilverLake sys","summary_zh":"Jack Henry & Associates, Inc. 是一家金融科技公司，透過科技解決方案和支付處理服務在美國將人們和金融機構連結起來。它透過四個部門運作：核心部門、支付部門、補充部門和企業服務部門。核心部分為銀行和信用合作社提供核心資訊處理平台，其中包括處理存款、貸款、總帳交易和維護集中帳戶持有人資訊所需的整合應用程式。支付部門提供安全支付處理工具和服務，包括ATM、資金流動和嵌入式支付功能、遠端存款擷取處理、風險管理產品和服務、金融卡和信用卡處理服務以及線上和行動帳單支付解決方案。補充部門提供軟體、託管處理平台和服務，包括數位/行動銀行、財務、線上開戶、詐欺/反洗錢以及貸款/存款解決方案。企業服務部門提供硬體和其他產品。它為金融服務組織和企業實體提供專業的財務績效、影像和支付、資訊安全和風險管理、零售交付以及線上和行動解決方案。該公司還提供SilverLake系統","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"資訊科技服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":162.26,"h":163.05,"l":160.0,"c":160.77,"v":869600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":160.31,"h":161.69,"l":159.18,"c":161.59,"v":652900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":161.6,"h":162.09,"l":159.88,"c":161.87,"v":660000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":161.29,"h":163.18,"l":160.45,"c":162.24,"v":595400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":162.99,"h":162.99,"l":160.43,"c":162.53,"v":608900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":162.28,"h":163.65,"l":161.73,"c":162.75,"v":652300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":162.1,"h":162.31,"l":158.76,"c":159.1,"v":892200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":159.23,"h":161.48,"l":158.91,"c":161.42,"v":781200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":160.3,"h":161.29,"l":159.87,"c":160.12,"v":693400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":160.12,"h":160.78,"l":157.71,"c":158.43,"v":797100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":158.08,"h":159.25,"l":157.36,"c":159.07,"v":695400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":160.0,"h":161.92,"l":159.46,"c":159.78,"v":696200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":159.48,"h":160.22,"l":154.39,"c":154.47,"v":1175800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":155.05,"h":155.24,"l":151.69,"c":151.97,"v":3452800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":152.06,"h":152.83,"l":150.63,"c":151.45,"v":922000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":151.45,"h":151.9,"l":149.39,"c":150.02,"v":642800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":150.15,"h":151.83,"l":150.15,"c":151.5,"v":884200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":1