h":"Jack Henry & Associates (JKHY) 股票剛剛變動，那麼關注背後的原因是什麼？"},{"title":"Bank of America Begins Coverage on Jack Henry & Associates (NASDAQ:JKHY)","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNNFJjYkl5ZjczUGctWFUwTEhaelYtc2VHLWFjMUk2R1ppeXFhZ0k3T2t2MjNrb0tEcEQyTWhfS292WFVJcUVfaDJ1OXFUa0ZIUE43dXFNdUVfQy1kQ1lESnhTQklCaVUxN2w1WnJSREFaUVNVX1I1Q2NQZUc3Q0tWbFJhMnFaSUZsNTBvU1g5MDRGaHZrLWpjOFRCN0N5eTRTcFNUdTRtajVkSlVhMVJJUTBsUjJkLV9hendLV0ZoMGxwMnFUSFdsZHZn?oc=5","date":"2026-10-15","zh":"美國銀行開始覆蓋 Jack Henry & Associates（納斯達克股票代碼：JKHY）"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-08-28","period":"2026-06-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/779152/000077915226000067/jkhy-20260630.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Jack Henry & Associates, Inc. is a well-rounded financial technology company that strengthens connections between financial institutions and the people and businesses they serve. For 50 years, we have provided technology solutions to help banks and credit unions innovate faster, strategically differentiate, and successfully compete while serving the evolving needs of their accountholders. We empower over 7,200 financial institutions and diverse corporate entities with people-inspired innovation, personal service, and insight-driven solutions.","zh":null},{"en":"We strengthen the connections between people and their financial institutions through technology and services that reduce the barriers to financial health.","zh":null},{"en":"This mission has always been part of the foundation on which Jack Henry was built. Our founders, Jack Henry and Jerry Hall, were committed to their community and believed they could help financial institutions better serve the needs of their accountholders by using more innovative technology and services.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"The marketing and sales initiatives within the core business lines are primarily focused on identifying banks and credit unions evaluating alternative core information and transaction processing solutions. Our specialized core-agnostic niche solutions are sold to complement existing technology platforms to banks and credit unions of all asset sizes and charters.","zh":null},{"en":"Sales executives are responsible for the activities required to earn new clients in assigned territories, and regional account executives are responsible for nurturing client relationships and cross selling additional products and services. Our sales professionals receive base salaries and performance-based commission compensation. Sales support staff provide a variety of services, including product and service demonstrations, responses to prospect-issued requests-for-proposals, and proposal and contract generation. Our marketing department supports sales with lead generation, product adoption, and brand-building activities, including participation in state-specific, regional, and national trade shows; print and online advertising; client newsletters; ongoing promotional campaigns; and media relations. We also host an annual national education conference, which provides opportunities to ","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"The market for companies providing technology solutions to financial services organizations is competitive, and we expect that competition from both existing competitors and companies entering our existing or future markets will remain strong. Some of our current competitors have longer operating histories, larger client bases, and greater financial resources. The principal competitive factors affecting the market for technology solutions include culture, service, innovation, strategy, and execution, along with product/service functionality, price, operating flexibility, and ease-of-use. For more than a decade, there has been significant consolidation among providers of products and services designed for banks and credit unions, and this consolidation is expected to continue in the future.","zh":null},{"en":"Our core solutions compete with large vendors that provide information and transaction processing solutions to banks and credit unions, including Fidelity National Information Services, Inc.; Fiserv, Inc.; Corelation, Inc.; and Finastra. Our core agnostic solutions compete with an array of disparate fintech vendors that provide niche solutions to financial services organizations and corporate entities.","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"Payments","val":936006000,"zh":"Payments"},{"name":"Core","val":768452000,"zh":"Core"},{"name":"Complementary","val":752214000,"zh":"Complementary"}],"total":2544339000},"prod":{"end":"2026-06-30","items":[{"name":"License & Service","val":1448003000,"zh":"License & Service"},{"name":"Processing","val":1096336000,"zh":"Processing"},{"name":"Outsourcing Cloud","val":816097000,"zh":"Outsourcing Cloud"},{"name":"In House Support","val":336830000,"zh":"In House Support"},{"name":"Product Deliveryand Service","val":295076000,"zh":"Product Deliveryand Service"}],"total":2544339000}},"peers":["ROL","IT","IEX","MKTX","CDW"]}}